date-released: 2024-10-28
url: https://github.com/Tin11Mn/ASD-GraphNet-Audit
title: "ASD-GraphNet-Audit: Strict Evaluation of Graph-Based ASD Classification on ABIDE"
abstract: >
  This project audits the performance of graph-based machine learning methods 
  on the ABIDE dataset for autism spectrum disorder (ASD) classification. 
  We reveal significant data leakage in existing pipelines and provide a 
  strict no-leakage baseline of 58.12%.
keywords:
